usage: experiment.py [-h] --mode {dev,confirmation} --queries QUERIES --output
                     OUTPUT [--arms {A0,A1,A2,A3} [{A0,A1,A2,A3} ...]]
                     [--selection SELECTION]
                     [--selection-sha256 SELECTION_SHA256]

E04 local pilot: frozen V2 inputs, weighted RRF and shared real rerank pools.
This module never alters the frozen runners, production application or
knowledge repository. Model calls are made only through the original
LocalModels interface.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {dev,confirmation}
  --queries QUERIES
  --output OUTPUT
  --arms {A0,A1,A2,A3} [{A0,A1,A2,A3} ...]
  --selection SELECTION
  --selection-sha256 SELECTION_SHA256
